        <body>
            <div xml:id="d203">

                <pb facs="0259" n="199" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg199"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received June 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2206.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my dispatch No. 2203, of the 25th
                    instant, I inclosed a copy of the précis of the recent treaty of peace made at
                    Shimonoseki between Japan and China. I have now the honor to inclose the full
                    text thereof.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>



                <xi:include href="d203-a1.xml" xpointer="d203-a1"/>
